
bromigOS live medium. The desktop is on tty1 (it signs in by itself).

  Install bromigOS: the welcome card, the desktop's INSTALL panel, or the app launcher
  bromigos-installer --text     the same installer in this terminal (sudo bromigos-iso-install)
  bromigos-iso-install --help   the unattended forms (an answer file, archinstall's config)

Arch's own tools are here too: archinstall, arch-install-scripts, the rescue tools.

